        </p>
      </Card>

      <Card title="Managing Cloud Costs" badge="FinOps" glow="cyan">
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 font-bold mb-1">Preventing accidental runaway bills.</p>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-900 font-medium">
          Because cloud scales automatically, a software bug can accidentally start 500 servers and generate a huge surprise bill.
        </p>
      </Card>

      <Card title="Security Across Networks" badge="Zero Trust" glow="amber">
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-700 font-bold mb-1">Securing microservices without old office firewalls.</p>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-900 font-medium">
          Systems must check authentication on every single message using secure keys, because servers talk over open networks.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>
    <SpeakerNotes>
